+The action grid (30 Hz), inference timer (5 Hz), plan stride (about 4 s), and command publication (125 Hz) describe different mechanisms. In the original E1 cohort, actual pose and force receipt-event records are approximately 125 Hz; the additional R report retains that observer configuration. E2 retains the earlier approximately 18 Hz archived feedback CSVs under a 20 Hz logging cap. Neither rate identifies the sensor's acquisition frequency or a policy replanning rate. Existing timing, freshness, workspace, and stop/hold checks remain common infrastructure.
