+
+\section{Protocol Boundaries across E1--E3}
+E1's first automatic procedural completion, E2's operator-based completed interval, and E3's before/after image-area change answer different questions. E3's preserved first-stop diagnostics are not substitutes for either E1 completion time or a time of ink removal. N retains its earlier Python HOME implementation; P1 uses controller PTP return, and D1/D2 use PTP with commanded-release confirmation logic. The selected run records retain these differences. A common policy and lower-level contact-control structure do not imply identical termination, recording frequency, or replanning intervals across experiments.
